// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// TradingView → /api/webhook/tv alert message template
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
// Paste the JSON block below into the "Message" box of a TradingView alert
// (Create Alert → Notifications → Webhook URL → https://<host>/api/webhook/tv).
//
// TradingView placeholder substitutions used here:
//   {{ticker}}                  → symbol, e.g. AAPL
//   {{strategy.order.action}}   → "buy" or "sell" (lowercased entry side)
//   {{close}}                   → bar close price (numeric)
//   {{timenow}}                 → alert FIRE time as a REAL ISO-8601 UTC
//                                 timestamp, e.g. 2026-05-29T14:31:07Z.
//                                 This drives the server freshness check —
//                                 it MUST NOT be empty.
//   {{time}}                    → the BAR open time (ISO-8601). Reported as
//                                 bar_time for audit; NOT used for freshness.
//   {{interval}}                → chart interval, e.g. 1D, 60, 5
//   {{strategy.order.id}}       → strategy order id (part of the dedupe key)
//
// Authenticity: the shared secret may travel in the JSON body (below) OR in an
// X-TV-Secret request header. The header takes precedence. The secret must be
// at least 8 characters and is always redacted in logs / error responses.
//
// Idempotency: TradingView retries a webhook on any non-2xx response. The
// server derives a stable event_key from
//     sha256(symbol | action | interval | timenow | strategy_order_id)
// so a redelivered alert is de-duplicated and returns the ORIGINAL signal_id
// ({"status":"duplicate", ...}) instead of queuing a second candidate. Keep
// {{timenow}} and {{strategy.order.id}} in the payload so retries collapse to
// the same key.
//
// Note: "close"/flat exits are NOT routed here — action must be buy or sell.
//
// ─── Alert message (JSON) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
{
  "symbol": "{{ticker}}",
  "action": "{{strategy.order.action}}",
  "price": {{close}},
  "timenow": "{{timenow}}",
  "bar_time": "{{time}}",
  "interval": "{{interval}}",
  "strategy_order_id": "{{strategy.order.id}}",
  "secret": "replace-with-your-TV_WEBHOOK_SECRET"
}
